OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fshowers and blustery winds around
OL,7,FLothian and Borders through the
OL,8,Fevening and overnight. Otherwise dry
OL,9,Fwith clear intervals developing
OL,10,Fallowing a frost to develop. Minimum
OL,11,FTemperature -2C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FMostly dry on Tuesday with
OL,14,Fsome sunshine, but feeling chilly.
OL,15,FIsolated showers along the
OL,16,FBerwickshire coast. Maximum
OL,17,FTemperature 6C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
